{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06757","headline":"巴陵别刘处士 · 王昌龄","name":"巴陵别刘处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"刘生隐岳阳，心远洞庭水。\n偃帆入山郭，一宿楚云里。\n竹映秋馆深，月寒江风起。\n烟波桂阳接，日夕数千里。\n嫋嫋清夜猿，孤舟坐如此。\n湘中有来鴈，雨雪候音旨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06757.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06757","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}